<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 727 0 R
/E (AfCFTA Trade Integration Boost: In February 2025, Reuters reported renewed momentum under the African Continental Free Trade Area \(AfCFTA\). Member states accelerated efforts to harmonise trade regulations, reduce tariffs, and streamline customs processes, creating a more unified market. This initiative is set to unlock significant intra-African commerce, although it faces challenges such as overcoming entrenched bureaucratic hurdles. The opportunity lies in leveraging simplified trade rules to stimulate business activity and drive sustainable regional growth.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
